{
  "about": "Deterministic layer choices for the LPC townsfolk sheets (#832): one sheet per townsfolk role of data/npcs.js (NPC_ROLES) and per people of data/races.js (the people's head, skin and hair come from lpc-heroes.json, so a Warband town's folk are as green as its heroes), composed by scripts/art/lpc-townsfolk.mjs with the #809 pipeline (scripts/art/lpc-heroes.mjs). Same layer syntax as lpc-heroes.json plus: `fac` (the layer only for that faction), and a `variant` given as {\"0\": a, \"1\": b} (one per faction). `tint` recolours the layer to the faction key ramp, as the heroes' tabard. Townsfolk carry no weapon but the tools of a trade, and wear the cloth of their work, so a role reads by its clothes at 1x and never as one more hero.",
